  "about": {
    "pl": "Modlitwa po Komunii II Niedzieli Adwentu. Nie prosi o nic nowego, lecz o to, by przyjęty pokarm zmienił sąd o rzeczach: czym gardzić, a co miłować.",
    "en": "The postcommunion of the Second Sunday of Advent. It asks for nothing new, but that the food just received should change the judgment of things — what to despise and what to love."
  },
